# The RAM tiers are symlinks out of the repository. Nothing in them is ever
# committed; they hold logs, traced-fence autosaves, converted textures, and
# scratch that is regenerated on demand.
tmp

# Deprecated temporary scripts are kept for exactly one commit and then removed,
# so they are never ignored -- they are supposed to show up in the record once.

# Converted texture forms of the painting are build artefacts and belong in the
# RAM tier, which is already ignored above. The originals in inspiration-pictures/
# are not ours and are never derived from in place -- see the notice there.

# Editor and OS litter.
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
